msgid "G1189_Hirschkafer"
msgstr "Stachel"

msgid "G1189_Hirschkafer_descr"
msgstr ""
"A project for a German tank destroyer from the 1970s based on the Leopard 1 "
"with an autoloader. The designers believed the vehicle could efficiently hit"
" enemy tanks from ranges at which return fire would not pose a threat. "
"However, it was found that this task could be performed perfectly well by "
"the latest Bundeswehr tank, the Leopard 2, which was in active development "
"at the time. As a result, the military decided not to build a prototype of "
"the vehicle."

msgid "G1189_Hirschkafer_short"
msgstr "Stachel"
